# Who may record a "Verifier pass" on an agent-lane pull request (verifier_pass.py).
# One GitHub login a line. Dalaun's lane: only he changes this list.
#
# Only the verifier app belongs here. The verifier-pass workflow posts every
# verdict under this app, after its script has checked the head commit, the
# report, the green checks and that whoever dispatched the run didn't write the
# pull request. A login listed here could also post a "Verifier pass" status
# directly, skipping those checks, so no badge that writes pull requests or
# runs errands (the foundation badge, Grokbot, Muse, the vault's Claude) is
# listed. Which agent did the verifying is recorded as "asked by" in the
# verdict comment. Copilot and other review bots never count, even if listed.
dalaun-finchdagen-verifier[bot]
